OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FScattered early showers soon
OL,6,Fclear the northeast, leaving a few
OL,7,Fmorning showers in the west. Showers
OL,8,Fbecome frequent, heavy and wintry for
OL,9,Fa time from late afternoon. Becoming
OL,10,Fwindy form the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers will continue
OL,13,Fovernight, these become frequent and
OL,14,Fheavy at times while continuing wintry
OL,15,Fat height. Strong northwest winds and
OL,16,Fcoastal gales overnight.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FAnother day of blustery
OL,19,Fshowers, these wintry over high
OL,20,Fground. Strong winds and coastal gales
OL,21,Fease down from the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
